// A kind of actor (`content::actors::ActorSpec`): the map glyph that
// places it (any lowercase letter without a meaning of its own in maps;
// none for the player, whom maps place with `p`), the behaviour it runs
// (none for the player), its hit points, its weapon (`Sweep` is
// `assets/weapons/sweep.ron`) or fighting style (`Blade` is
// `assets/styles/blade.ron`), and what a blow knocks out of it (an
// effect: `Blood` is `assets/effects/blood.ron`).
(hp: 2, style: Blade, bleeds: Blood)
